gy's Sharpe ratio drops significantly from 1.63 in research to -0.23 in sealed data, indicating overfitting. The trial haircut analysis shows the claimed Sharpe is inflated, suggesting the strategy may not be robust. The evidence shows the claimed performance is not real.","unsupported":false,"defaulted":false}}],"calls":8,"tokens_in":12669,"tokens_out":476,"seconds":221.322}